# PatoLex prep-offload profiling run log

Question: should CPU-bound render/preprocess (and possibly Tesseract) move OFF the
5-series GPU boxes onto the 3060? Bounded measurement only — no infra changes;
one transfer test, cleaned up.

Boxes: 5090 = patolex@100.70.54.56 ; 3060 = patolex@100.113.254.6 (archive D:\PatoLex-archive)
Source data: 5090 logs (ocr-5090-run.log, queue-worker.log) + ocr_only_5090.py + one live scp test.

